window.LEARN_CONTENT=window.LEARN_CONTENT||{};window.LEARN_CONTENT["a-88b1ced5fbccd242"]={"zh":"<h1 id=\"analytics-api-api\">Analytics API（分析 API）</h1> <blockquote> <p>如需完整的文档索引，请参阅 <a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/llms.txt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">llms.txt（需联网）</a>。在文档页面 URL 后添加 <code>.md</code>，即可获取该页面的 Markdown 版本。</p> </blockquote> <p>Analytics API 为 ChatGPT 工作区提供汇总后的使用情况和活动指标。统一的 Daily Usage Analytics API（每日使用情况分析 API）会报告 ChatGPT、Codex 和 Work 的每日使用情况。使用前，请先确认此端点已在你的工作区启用。</p> <p><a href=\"https://chatgpt.com/public/admin/api-reference\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Admin API 参考（需联网）</a>是当前访问要求、路由、请求与响应架构、指标、时间语义和分页规则的权威来源。</p> <p><a id=\"when-to-use-the-analytics-api\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"analytics-api\">何时使用 Analytics API</h2> <p>在以下情况下，Analytics API 可能适用：</p> <ul> <li>自动生成定期的工作区使用情况报告。</li> <li>将汇总使用指标与组织内部数据关联起来。</li> <li>为获准的受众构建受控的报告层。</li> <li>避免让集成依赖交互式仪表板。</li> </ul> <p>它不是原始审计日志接口。如果工作流程需要可审计的活动记录，请使用 <a href=\"#/article/a-9d54fab7ad7294d0\">Compliance API</a>。</p> <p><a id=\"confirm-the-administration-boundaries\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_1\">确认管理边界</h2> <p>Analytics API 的结果按 ChatGPT 工作区范围划分。对于统一的 Daily Usage Analytics API，请使用带有 <code>enterprise.analytics.usage.read</code> 权限范围的工作区级 Admin 密钥。Codex 权限范围 <code>codex.enterprise.analytics.read</code> 并不授予对此端点的访问权限。</p> <p>API 参考是密钥配置、权限范围要求、路由、架构、字段、时间语义和分页行为的权威依据。本页面不重复这些接口约定。</p> <p><a id=\"related-docs\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_2\">相关文档</h2> <ul> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-e8a44d8693c261b7\">工作区分析</a></li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-811aa7aeaf6b8cd4\">管理员推出指南</a></li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-05f8d80ccc7b0b64\">治理</a></li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-9d54fab7ad7294d0\">Compliance API</a></li> </ul>","en":"<h1 id=\"analytics-api\">Analytics API</h1> <blockquote> <p>For the complete documentation index, see <a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/llms.txt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">llms.txt (online)</a>. Markdown versions of documentation pages are available by appending <code>.md</code> to the page URL.</p> </blockquote> <p>The Analytics APIs provide aggregated usage and activity metrics for a ChatGPT workspace. The unified Daily Usage Analytics API reports daily ChatGPT, Codex, and Work usage. Confirm that the endpoint is enabled for your workspace before using it.</p> <p>The <a href=\"https://chatgpt.com/public/admin/api-reference\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Admin API reference (online)</a> is the source of truth for current access requirements, routes, request and response schemas, metrics, time semantics, and pagination.</p> <h2 id=\"when-to-use-the-analytics-api\">When to use the Analytics API</h2> <p>The Analytics API is appropriate when you need to:</p> <ul> <li>Automate recurring workspace usage reporting.</li> <li>Join aggregated usage metrics with internal organizational data.</li> <li>Build a controlled reporting layer for approved audiences.</li> <li>Avoid coupling an integration to an interactive dashboard.</li> </ul> <p>It's not a raw audit-log interface. Use the <a href=\"#/article/a-9d54fab7ad7294d0\">Compliance API</a> when the workflow requires auditable activity records.</p> <h2 id=\"confirm-the-administration-boundaries\">Confirm the administration boundaries</h2> <p>Analytics API results are scoped to a ChatGPT workspace. For the unified Daily Usage Analytics API, use a workspace-scoped Admin key with <code>enterprise.analytics.usage.read</code>. The Codex scope <code>codex.enterprise.analytics.read</code> doesn't grant access to that endpoint.</p> <p>The API reference owns current key provisioning, scope requirements, routes, schemas, fields, time semantics, and pagination behavior. This page doesn't duplicate that contract.</p> <h2 id=\"related-docs\">Related docs</h2> <ul> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-e8a44d8693c261b7\">Workspace analytics</a></li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-811aa7aeaf6b8cd4\">Admin rollout guide</a></li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-05f8d80ccc7b0b64\">Governance</a></li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-9d54fab7ad7294d0\">Compliance API</a></li> </ul>"};
